{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00348","headline":"巡衣锦军制还乡歌 · 吴越王钱鏐","name":"巡衣锦军制还乡歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三节还乡兮挂锦衣，碧天朗朗兮爱日晖。\n功成道上兮列旌旗，父老远来兮相追随。\n家山乡眷兮会时稀，今朝设宴兮觥散飞。\n斗牛无孛兮民无欺，吴越一王兮驷马归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越王钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}